  "notes": "{穏|おだ}やか is a na-adjective meaning calm, peaceful, gentle, or mild.\n\nFORMS:\n- {穏|おだ}やかな + noun (attributive)\n- {穏|おだ}やか⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ + verb (adverbial)\n- {穏|おだ}やかだ (predicative)\n- {穏|おだ}やかで (te-form)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {穏|おだ}やかな⟦{天気|てんき}→天気：00582_tenki⟧: calm weather\n- {穏|おだ}やかな⟦{海|うみ}→海：00556_umi⟧: calm sea\n- {穏|おだ}やかな⟦{性格|せいかく}→性格：03371_seikaku⟧: gentle personality\n- {穏|おだ}やかな⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧: a serene face\n- {穏|おだ}やか⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{話|はな}す→話す：00467_hanasu⟧: to speak gently\n- {穏|おだ}やか⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{暮|く}らす→暮らす：01937_kurasu⟧: to live peacefully\n- ⟦{気持|きも}ち→気持ち：01385_kimochi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{穏|おだ}やか⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to feel calm\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{静|しず}か→静か：00755_shizuka⟧: quiet, silent (emphasizes lack of noise)\n- ⟦{温和|おんわ}→温和：27846_onwa⟧: gentle, mild (often for personality/climate)\n- ⟦{平穏|へいおん}→平穏：12446_heion⟧: peaceful, tranquil (more formal)\n- ⟦おとなしい→大人しい：02339_otonashii⟧: docile, quiet (often for personality)\n\nUSAGE:\n{穏|おだ}やか suggests a pleasant, undisturbed state—whether weather, mood, personality, or atmosphere.",
